OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCool and windy, with frequent
OL,6,Fblustery showers in the northwest,
OL,7,Fwith some heavy at times with a risk
OL,8,Fof hail and thunder. Drier, bright and
OL,9,Fbreezy further south and east, with
OL,10,Fmore in the way of sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers becoming lighter,
OL,13,Ffewer and further between overnight,
OL,14,Fmainly affecting western areas. Drier
OL,15,Fwith clear spells widely, allowing a
OL,16,Fcolder night than of late with some
OL,17,Fmist or fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
